Binding and executor sources originate from moonbit-community/sqlite3.mbt:
https://github.com/moonbit-community/sqlite3.mbt

Upstream baseline: 1405639063c52b1474b2622d4c5b5e36110aa74c.
The copied sources include our host API changes from local commit
182dfc2ad306f719a96d849e3e9526e00e438c63 (extended diagnostics, native
authorizer registration, and job lifecycle documentation). Those changes
were not merged upstream. The binding sources are licensed under Apache-2.0;
see LICENSE.

This module retains only the native host bindings, moves them into its root
package, and adapts the tests to that package. Host additions include raw
preparation tails, statement-null and busy checks, and background cleanup jobs.

The SQLite amalgamation (sqlite3.c and sqlite3.h) is version 3.53.2, copied
unchanged from libsqlite3-sys 0.38.2 to match the Rust moonrun dependency.
Crate checksum: f1d20bef17f513b9b3004532233187769cd072d790971f4e4da0e346eb6401e8.
Its original public-domain notices are retained. sqlite_engine.c mirrors the
bundled build configuration in that crate's build.rs.
